	// HYPOTHESIS-2: Small load-proportional reduction to prefix weight (not score penalty) for overloaded instances provides gentler anti-hotspot protection
	// MECHANISM-2: Instead of penalizing prefix scores directly (which causes oscillation), reduce w0 slightly when routing to heavily loaded instances, preserving cache affinity gradient
